stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> Active: R1 created atomically
  Active --> Extended: R2 authorized extension
  Active --> Confirmed: R3 order confirmed
  Extended --> Confirmed: R3 order confirmed
  Active --> Expired: R4 timeout (default 15 min)
  Extended --> Expired: R4 extended timeout
  Active --> Released: R5 payment failed, cart changed, cancelled
  Extended --> Released: R5 payment failed or cancelled
  Active --> ReviewRequired: R6 payment ambiguous
  Extended --> ReviewRequired: R6 payment ambiguous
  Expired --> ReviewRequired: R7 late successful payment
  ReviewRequired --> Confirmed: R8 stock re-secured and payment reconciled
  ReviewRequired --> Released: R9 payment failed or cannot fulfil
  ReviewRequired --> Expired: R10 review hold limit reached
  Confirmed --> Consumed: R11 packed — nominal quantity deducted
  Confirmed --> Released: R12 cancelled before packing, or shortage quantity
